    "title_en": "Description of the decay $ϕ\\to π^+π^-$ in the NJL chiral quark model",
    "abstract_en": "The doubly suppressed decay $ϕ\\to π^+π^-$ is described in the chiral NJL quark model. This decay occurs in violation of the OZI rule and isotopic invariance. Two possible channels are considered. The first channel involves $ϕ-ω$ mixing and the subsequent decay of $ω\\to π^+π^-$. In the second channel, the decay occurs via an intermediate $ρ$ meson.",
